refactor(benchmark): gather the benchmark into its own folder

Eight flat src/benchmark-*.ts modules become src/benchmark/{index,corpus,cost,
estimator,items-routing,items-judgement,live,report}.ts, so the package root
stops mixing one feature's parts in with the plugin's own entry points.

Cross-directory imports inside the benchmark use the #src/ alias rather than
../jev/...: the lint config forbids parent-relative imports, and the alias
resolves through both tsconfig paths and the package imports map without
weakening that rule. The build inlines it, so no unresolved specifier reaches
lib/.

The live numbers are unchanged by the move.
